# Live eval harness output (run pre-release on-box; not source). Matches
# directory CONTENTS (not the directory itself) so the P3a carve-out below
# can re-include one stable-named file — a trailing-slash directory match
# would block that negation, since git never descends into an excluded
# directory to look for it.
scripts/eval/results/*
# P3a (ADR-0056) honesty audit harness: exactly one stable-named synthetic
# sample IS committed (per architecture-deepening-slices.md § P3a — "commit
# a sample/synthetic run so the format is reviewable"), so the report format
# is reviewable before any real classifier output exists. Regenerated,
# timestamped --mode=live/--mode=synthetic runs stay ignored, same as every
# other harness's output in this directory.
!scripts/eval/results/thought-step-honesty-audit-synthetic-sample.md
!scripts/eval/results/thought-step-honesty-audit-synthetic-sample.json
